# The meal, shared by cannibalism-feat-yes.keys and cannibalism-feat-no.keys.
# Wizard summon a brown bear (CR 5, measured: 250 XP = 50 x CR; non-sapient, so no alignment charge; a corpse whose challenge rating exceeds the eater's pays full experience in Creature::DevourMonster), Genocide Everything leaves its corpse, eat it to the
# end. The sheet's "XP" line before and after is the oracle.
w
y
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Animals"
@choose "brown bear"
RIGHT
ENTER
w
@choose "Genocide Everything"
@dump:killed

d
@expect "Gender"
w
"meal-pre"
ENTER
ESC

RIGHT
@while "You see here" ESC
e
@choose "(ground) brown bear corpse"
@while "Stop eating" n
@while "-- more --" SPACE
@while "Eating" SPACE
@while "-- more --" SPACE
@while "#------" SPACE

v
@dump:log-meal
@while "Messages" ESC

d
@expect "Gender"
w
"meal-post"
ENTER
ESC
@quit
